Patch intent:
Remove documentation, benchmarks, onboarding guides, and README links that
exist solely for the removed sponsored integration discovery system.

Why it exists:
The local build no longer includes a remote sponsored catalog or partner
attribution, so its operational and user-facing documentation must not remain.

Upstream integration points:
The patch removes discovery-specific documents under docs/ and the README link
to the sponsor onboarding guide.

Update guidance:
Do not restore documentation for sponsored discovery or attribution. Keep
ordinary MCP and OpenAI-compatible endpoint documentation intact.

Validation:
! rg -n -i 'sponsored discovery|discover_tools|integration_tools' README.md docs
